<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "2000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> had headed into the forest that led to that secret base.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had been searching around here by himself, then...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That's it! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> thought </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> was at the secret base, so he came straight this way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's why he was able to find </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> on his own.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, are you feeling okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah... haah... Yes, I'm fine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How is that fine? She's even more unsteady than she was at Toyotake Station...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...! Where are you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cried out in a feeble voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could he even hear her, out in these vast mountains?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"............
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Mama</STYLE>, I smell blood. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's coming from over there!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> ran on, deeper into the forest.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, come on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> arm slung over my shoulder, I went after </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And right after that―</STYLE><PG>
"He's here!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Right nearby, </STYLE>Kana-chan's<STYLE ID="1"> voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> stood in front of a lone </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="かっぷく">portly</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> man.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He was sitting slumped against a tree.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎大けが.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wh-who's there...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Papa</STYLE>, thank goodness! You're alive!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That voice... is that </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="2">...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Why did you come back...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I told you to run..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ死神.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Hurry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">let's run...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> finally collapsed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"S-</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, leave you behind... and run? As if I could...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You idiot... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">done for now, so, together with </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was sitting in a large pool of blood.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He was bleeding far too badly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> looked up at the sky.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"In the settlement... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">what happened...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\雲わすれの夏.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\山火事夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">An orange that seemed to scorch the starry sky.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A huge blaze, visible through the trees.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The fire at the Niimura house seemed to be spreading all around.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At that rate, it would soon swallow this place too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"The Arata settlement... is finished now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It went on for 800 years, and today..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Papa</STYLE>, don't say that... It's only the house we're losing... 
{PAUSE ""}
We can just build the house again. 
{PAUSE ""}
As long as we're here, the Arata settlement will never be gone!
{PAUSE ""}
　So... let's run away together..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎大けが.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"You two... take these..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\注射器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "100" "200" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム4" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\女神\注射器透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "400" "200" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> took something long and thin out of his pocket.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Syringes...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One of cherry-pink liquid, one of clear liquid.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"There's only enough left for one person, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">if you inject the pink one into a muscle... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">for just 10 minutes... you can push your strength to the human limit... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Use it to get away... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But after that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">you have to inject the clear one as well... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">you can escape the curse-killing."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2,アイテム3,アイテム4,アイテム5,アイテム6" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"No, <STYLE ID="2">Papa</STYLE>! I can't leave <STYLE ID="2">Papa</STYLE> behind...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please...! Don't die...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I can't see very well anymore... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">This is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\山火事夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The short, rapid breathing of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was growing shallower.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> could do was hold his hand and watch.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I, too, was about to witness the moment a family was torn apart.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I hadn't come here, would none of this have happened?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Either way, today might have been the day </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> was fated to be driven by that murderous intent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But if she could have been given the falsificaso right away, the villagers would never have noticed and would have spent a peaceful night.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I hadn't come, it might have been some other, good ending.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"</STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">get along... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">all right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="2">Papa</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">""</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> whole body went limp all at once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">His eyes stayed half open and would not close.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Papa</STYLE>...! Why did you die...!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Dying because of me, that's just too cruel...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> dropped to her knees on the ground, her shoulders shaking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Like that, </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> was slowly drawn into </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> arms.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Curse-killing... what curse-killing...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1"> hasn't killed anyone! The only ones killing are the people afraid of the curse-killing!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What was cursed wasn't </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it was this settlement itself...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\山火事夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Because they want to be saved themselves, because they want to survive themselves, they just kill whoever is in the way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Weren't they all friends who'd lived together all this time...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That sudden selfishness, isn't it the same as mine...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Are all their hearts as twisted as mine?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just me being that way should be more than enough...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Enough.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I've had all I can take of families being torn apart.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">that mother bear and her cub, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and </STYLE>Kana-chan's<STYLE ID="1"> family too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I don't want to see it anymore.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I want to be gone from here now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll leave this place now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE>Kana-chan<STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I know how you feel, but we have to get out of here, fast..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You're right..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes, I know..."</STYLE>
