{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That blood splashed onto my face.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> stayed as she was, slumped over </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> body, and did not move.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> attacker, the shinigami who had cut her, also collapsed on the spot with a thud.</STYLE><PG>
